<title>USA: Texas/w Okla feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas/w Okla feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade was inactive in the Panhandle area Friday, USDA said. Slaughter steers and heifers not tested.</p>
<p>Feedlots reported light inquiry from buyers following a weekly movement of 89,500 head.</p>
<p>Confirmed:   None   Week Ago:  3,900  Year Ago:  3,100</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720</p>
